  "cmd_name": "delete-cluster-nodes",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "You can call this operation to remove one or more nodes from a cluster. The `ReleaseNode` parameter controls whether to release the underlying ENS compute instance, and its default value is `false`. If a node being removed is in the `failed` state, this parameter is ignored and the corresponding compute instance is released by default. For an ENS compute instance attached via a script from the `DescribeAttachScript` operation, this parameter is also ignored, and the instance is not released by default",
  "description_zh": "当您不再需要集群节点继续工作时，可以调用DeleteClusterNodes接口将集群中的节点移出集群。 ReleaseNode参数用于控制是否释放底层ENS计算实例，默认为false。\n如果需要删除的node为failed状态，该参数不生效，默认释放对应计算实例。\n对于您通过 DescribeAttachScript 接口获取脚本后，自行接入的ENS计算实例，该参数不生效，默认不释放对应计算实例",
